<title>UK: Senior Engineering sells thermal unit.</title>
<headline>Senior Engineering sells thermal unit.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Senior Engineering Group Plc said on Monday it had reached agreement for the sale of its thermal engineering division to Thermal Engineering International Corporation, a new company, for 28.25 million stg in total.</p>
<p>It said the sum would comprise 16 million stg in cash and 10 million stg by the issue of interest bearing loan notes with a final sum of 2.25 million stg related to collection of receivables to be paid within a year.</p>
</text>
